      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 5.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "hello, doctor i think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.32,
      "end_seconds": 11.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.4,
      "end_seconds": 20.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "so, I've been wanting contraception, doctor i'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.26,
      "end_seconds": 25.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.28,
      "end_seconds": 38.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.34,
      "end_seconds": 68.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, BP is 120 over 69. And SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.79,
      "end_seconds": 71.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Yeah, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.15,
      "end_seconds": 76.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.49,
      "end_seconds": 84.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "I'd say about four days. Actually, you know, no, closer to to two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.68,
      "end_seconds": 88.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.9,
      "end_seconds": 92.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "I, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.85,
      "end_seconds": 97.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Did you get breast lumps, smoking or migraine with aura?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.59,
      "end_seconds": 100.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.11,
      "end_seconds": 105.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "so, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.91,
      "end_seconds": 113.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.49,
      "end_seconds": 129.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.32,
      "end_seconds": 134.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.44,
      "end_seconds": 139.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.3,
      "end_seconds": 158.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.1,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.95,
      "end_seconds": 175.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.74,
      "end_seconds": 181.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.4,
      "end_seconds": 185.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.58,
      "end_seconds": 193.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "hmm, no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.0,
      "end_seconds": 208.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.01,
      "end_seconds": 211.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "no surgery, you know, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.58,
      "end_seconds": 218.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.93,
      "end_seconds": 220.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.73,
      "end_seconds": 223.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.7,
      "end_seconds": 237.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "your blood pressure is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.56,
      "end_seconds": 261.04,
      "duration_seconds": 17.48,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.16,
      "end_seconds": 265.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.12,
      "end_seconds": 275.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.1,
      "end_seconds": 294.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "You'll be taking levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. That's for contraception."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.3,
      "end_seconds": 302.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Oh, um, should I carry on if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.47,
      "end_seconds": 309.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.34,
      "end_seconds": 317.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "yes, carry on. Come back in three months. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.99,
      "end_seconds": 320.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.09,
      "end_seconds": 323.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
